      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "RTA at 600–800 °C for seconds to minutes will drive the proposed FeCoNi-Pt alloy from disordered fcc to L10 order.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11426066::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC11426066::web::003::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed composition and processing conditions can preserve configurational entropy of at least 1.0R.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Substrate-induced strain can assist RTA-induced formation of a high-anisotropy phase.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11426066::web::003::introduction",
        "PMC11426066::web::019::conclusion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "An inert or controlled atmosphere will avoid oxidation effects that could complicate ordering.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed treatment will form a single L10-ordered phase within the high-entropy alloy.",
